<hi rendition="#aq #g">Perinet Le clerc</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq #g">ou Paris en</hi> <hi rendition="#g">1443</hi>, <hi rendition="#aq">drame<lb/>
historique</hi>. Was die Leute &#x017F;chönes daran finden,<lb/>
